    "content": "/*B\"H\r\n  Chapter 80: The Buttons Stood On A Cliff Of Their Own.\r\n  Long headers may flow like thunder into another line, but the three chrome\r\n  buttons remain a fixed rail, untouched by the title's hunger.\r\n*/\r\n.transport-details > summary,\r\n.thought-envelope-card > summary,\r\n.thought-envelope-events > summary {\r\n  display: grid !important;\r\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\r\n  align-items: start;\r\n  gap: 0.55rem;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.event-summary-title,\r\n.event-title-wrap {\r\n  min-width: 0;\r\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\r\n  white-space: normal;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.event-panel-actions {\r\n  display: inline-flex !important;\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n  justify-content: flex-end;\r\n  gap: 0.35rem;\r\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\r\n  min-width: max-content;\r\n  align-self: start;\r\n  grid-column: 2;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.event-panel-actions button {\r\n  width: 1.85rem !important;\r\n  height: 1.85rem !important;\r\n  min-width: 1.85rem !important;\r\n  min-height: 1.85rem !important;\r\n  flex: 0 0 1.85rem !important;\r\n  line-height: 1;\r\n}\r\n",
